---
config:
  theme: neo-dark
  look: classic
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% #box rgb(4, 20, 10) Cloud — AAS and PCF management toolchain
        participant Agg as Aggregation Layer
        participant aas as AAS 
        participant Hub as PCF calculation Tool
        participant SG as PCF management Tool
    %% #end

    rect rgb(60, 9, 44)
    Note over Agg, Hub: Concurrent idle-time consumption reporting
        loop At regular reporting cadence T
            Agg->>Hub: Send Idle-time consumption records
            Hub->>Hub: Allocate and increment idle consumption <br>to the correct work-orders production that <br>took place during T
        end
    end

    rect rgb(18, 11, 41)
    Note over Hub, aas: Discover completed production phases (digital laufzettel shells)<br> ready for carbon footprint reporting (At regular schedules or triggered events)
        loop Until the queue returns no further unprocessed completed shell (each: latest, unprocessed, all operations terminal)
            Hub->>aas: GET next shell from queue
            aas-->>Hub: Shell reference, status, and operation data
            Hub-->>Hub: Put completed shell in queue buffer for processing
        end
    end

   
    Note over aas, SG: Process completed shells for carbon footprint reporting (at regular schedules or triggered events)

        loop Each completed shell reference from queue buffer
           rect rgb(18, 11, 41)
            Hub->>aas: GET bill of process and consumption <br>(operations, energy, materials, time bounds, product identifiers)
            aas-->>Hub: Production data for the work order
            end
            rect rgb(10, 55, 35)
            Note over Hub, SG: Calculate priliminary BOM carbon footprint
                loop For each material identifier
                    Hub->>SG: Request material footprint reference data
                    SG-->>Hub: Footprint per unit (e.g. kg CO2e)
                end
            end
 rect rgb(18, 64, 66)
            Hub->>Hub: Merge process and material contributions<br>Allocate idle share, derive product PCF

            Hub->>aas: GET product UUID 
            aas-->>Hub: product UUID

            Note over Hub, SG: Report total product carbon footprint (PCF) to SiGREEN
            Hub->>SG: POST factory emissions / PCF report 
            SG-->>Hub: Ack (PCF stored in SiGREEN)

            Hub->>Hub: Persist PCF report snapshot within work orders' database and <br> remove shell reference from queue buffer
            Hub->>aas: Update shell processing status to completed<br>(status, references, audit trail)
        end
    end
